FROM --platform=$BUILDPLATFORM golang:1.26.6-alpine3.23@sha256:5978cc992ad5ef96a7469713c8af849c1433824761ce3be2c56381403cd8d9a3 AS builder

ARG TARGETOS
ARG TARGETARCH
ARG GO_BUILD_FLAGS

WORKDIR /usr/local/src/custom-runner

COPY go.mod go.mod
COPY go.sum go.sum

# cache deps before building and copying source so that we don't need to re-download as much
# and so that source changes don't invalidate our downloaded layer
RUN go mod download

COPY cmd/ cmd/
COPY internal/ internal/

RUN CGO_ENABLED=0 GOOS=$TARGETOS GOARCH=$TARGETARCH go build $GO_BUILD_FLAGS -o /usr/local/bin/runner ./cmd

FROM alpine:3.24.1@sha256:28bd5fe8b56d1bd048e5babf5b10710ebe0bae67db86916198a6eec434943f8b

RUN apk add --update --no-cache socat

COPY --from=builder /usr/local/bin/runner /runner

# The command API executes arbitrary shell; do not hand it uid 0.
USER 65534:65534

ENTRYPOINT ["/runner"]
